# YemiShell — Agent Toolchain Configuration

## Skills

This project uses a unified agent skill system with two tiers:

### Primary Skill (Qt & Quickshell)
See [`.lingma/rules/SKILL.md`](.lingma/rules/SKILL.md) for the full reference covering:
- Qt C++ documentation, code review, and testing
- QML documentation, linting, profiling, and testing
- UI/UX design principles
- YemiShell-specific working rules

### Trae Builtin Skills
See `.lingma/rules/trae/` for Trae-integrated skills:
- **TRAE-code-review** — Structured code review with Mermaid diagrams, sub-agent cross-validation, and iterative fix loop
- **TRAE-debugger** — Evidence-driven debugging with Debug Server, scientific method hypothesis testing, and log instrumentation
- **TRAE-dynamic-ui** — Dynamic visual content generation via PureShowWidget (inline and panel modes)
- **TRAE-generate-mini-app** — Taro-based multi-platform mini-program code generation

## MCP Servers

Configured in `.roomodes` (canonical source). Currently available:

| Server | Purpose | Transport |
|--------|---------|-----------|
| `github` | Repository operations | stdio (via `github-mcp-server`) |
| `context7` | Library documentation lookup | stdio (npx `@upstash/context7-mcp`) |
| `sequential-thinking` | Structured reasoning | stdio (npx `@modelcontextprotocol/server-sequential-thinking`) |
| `cocoindex-code` | Code indexing and search | stdio (`ccc mcp`) |

### Secrets
API keys are stored as placeholders in config files. Set actual values before use:
- `GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN` — from https://github.com/settings/tokens
- `CONTEXT7_API_KEY` — from https://console.upstash.com

## Custom Modes

Workspace-scoped mode defined in `.roomodes`:
- **✍️ Mode Writer** — Create and edit custom modes with validation

Global modes registered in Zoocode installations vary by IDE. See `.roomodes` for the canonical project-mode definition.

## Configuration Back-Sync

To propagate changes from the canonical workspace config to all IDE installations:

```bash
./scripts/sync-mcp-config.sh
```

## IDE Installations

| IDE | Location | Zoocode Version | MCP Config Synced | Modes Synced |
|-----|----------|-----------------|--------------------|----|
| VS Code | `~/.vscode/extensions/` | 3.72.0 | Via `.roomodes` | Via `.roomodes` |
| Trae | `~/.trae/` | 3.72.0 | ✅ | ✅ |
| Kiro | `~/.kiro/` | 3.73.100299 | ✅ | ✅ |
| Antigravity IDE | `~/.antigravity-ide/` | 3.72.0 | — global modes preserved | — |
| Cursor | `~/.cursor/` | — | ✅ | N/A |
| Cline (standalone) | `~/.cline/` | — | ✅ | N/A |
| Roo | `~/.roo/` | — | ✅ | N/A |

